{"id":"A2-L060","title":"Superlatives: production and review","cefr":"A2","level":"A2","unit":"A2-U04","focus":"Superlatives — produção e revisão","targets":{"grammar":"Superlatives — produção e revisão","pron":"Ligação entre palavras","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["extreme","decade","patient","option","by far","storm of the decade","patient teacher","cheap option","trip of a lifetime","best result","worst case","high point","speaking class","extreme weather","life choice","lecture hall"],"field":"Experiências","genre":"Transcrição de palestra e podcast","skill":"Escuta","words_min":16},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 60 · Superlatives: production and review","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Superlatives — produção e revisão.","**Pronúncia:** Ligação entre palavras.","**10 palavras novas** (experiências).","**Texto do dia:** transcrição de palestra e podcast."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A2):** eu consigo ouvir uma palestra e escrever frases com superlativos."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você começa a praticar tarefas curtas no formato das provas.","Esta aula treina **ouvir e anotar informações (IELTS Listening, TOEFL Listening)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["extreme","extremo"],["decade","década"],["patient","paciente"],["option","opção"],["by far","de longe"],["storm of the decade","storm of the decade"],["patient teacher","patient teacher"],["cheap option","cheap option"],["trip of a lifetime","trip of a lifetime"],["best result","best result"],["worst case","worst case"],["high point","high point"],["speaking class","speaking class"],["extreme weather","extreme weather"],["life choice","life choice"],["lecture hall","lecture hall"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A lecture transcript","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"Lecture: Describing Extremes","paras":["Today we practice extremes. “It was **the worst** storm of the decade.” “She is **the most patient** teacher I know.” “This is **the least expensive** option.”","Notice **least**: it is the opposite of **most**. And remember: after a superlative we often use **ever**: “It was **the best** trip **ever**.”"],"kicker":"LECTURE TRANSCRIPT","by":"Prof. Ames","gloss":[["extreme","extremo"],["decade","década"],["patient","paciente"],["ever","já (em toda a vida)"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"The professor teaches extremes.","ans":"T","why":"practice extremes."},{"q":"Least is the same as most.","ans":"F","why":"opposite."},{"q":"Ever follows a superlative.","ans":"T","why":"often use ever."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“decade” = ?","opts":["década","decisão","dia"],"ans":0,"why":"decade."},{"q":"“ever” (aqui) = ?","opts":["já na vida","sempre","nunca"],"ans":0,"why":"ever."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Superlatives: production","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Estrutura","Exemplo"],"rows":[["the most + adj","**the most patient teacher**"],["the least + adj","**the least expensive option**"],["the + superlative + ever","**the best trip ever**"],["one of the + superlative + plural","**one of the best cities**"]],"cap":"Superlatives: production"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Para destacar: *by far the best.* Cuidado: *the most cheap* ✗ → *the cheapest*."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"It is ___ trip ever. (good)","a":"the best","why":"irregular."},{"s":"She is ___ patient teacher. (most)","a":"the most","why":"2+ sílabas."},{"s":"This is ___ expensive option. (least)","a":"the least","why":"least."},{"s":"One of the ___ cities. (best)","a":"best","why":"one of the."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["extreme","extremo"],["decade","década"],["patient","paciente"],["option","opção"],["by far","de longe"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["far","Peru","by"],"ans":"Peru by far","pt":"O Peru, de longe."},{"words":["the","worst","And"],"ans":"And the worst","pt":"E a pior?"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"extreme","pos":"word","pt":"extremo","ex":"An extreme sport.","expt":"Um esporte radical."},{"w":"decade","pos":"word","pt":"década","ex":"The last decade.","expt":"A última década."},{"w":"patient","pos":"word","pt":"paciente","ex":"A patient man.","expt":"Um homem paciente."},{"w":"option","pos":"word","pt":"opção","ex":"The best option.","expt":"A melhor opção."},{"w":"by far","pos":"word","pt":"de longe","ex":"By far the best.","expt":"De longe o melhor."},{"w":"storm of the decade","pos":"word","pt":"storm of the decade","ex":"tempestade da década","expt":"The storm of the decade."},{"w":"patient teacher","pos":"word","pt":"patient teacher","ex":"professor paciente","expt":"A patient teacher."},{"w":"cheap option","pos":"word","pt":"cheap option","ex":"opção barata","expt":"A cheap option."},{"w":"trip of a lifetime","pos":"word","pt":"trip of a lifetime","ex":"viagem de uma vida","expt":"A trip of a lifetime."},{"w":"best result","pos":"word","pt":"best result","ex":"melhor resultado","expt":"The best result."},{"w":"worst case","pos":"word","pt":"worst case","ex":"pior caso","expt":"The worst case."},{"w":"high point","pos":"word","pt":"high point","ex":"ponto alto","expt":"The high point."},{"w":"speaking class","pos":"word","pt":"speaking class","ex":"aula de conversação","expt":"A speaking class."},{"w":"extreme weather","pos":"word","pt":"extreme weather","ex":"clima extremo","expt":"Extreme weather."},{"w":"life choice","pos":"word","pt":"life choice","ex":"escolha de vida","expt":"A life choice."},{"w":"lecture hall","pos":"word","pt":"lecture hall","ex":"auditório","expt":"A lecture hall."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**What was the best trip ever?** — Qual foi a melhor viagem de todas?","**Peru, by far.** — O Peru, de longe.","**And the worst?** — E a pior?","**That’s why…** — É por isso que…","**Because of this…** — Por causa disso…","**In order to…** — A fim de…","**So as to…** — Para…"]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"die","pt":"morrer","forms":[["I / you / we / they die","Plants die in winter."],["he / she / it dies","The fire dies."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"After class","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"After class","lines":[["Ana","What was the best trip ever?","Qual foi a melhor viagem de todas?"],["Leo","Peru, by far.","O Peru, de longe."],["Ana","And the worst?","E a pior?"],["Leo","The one with the storm.","A da tempestade."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Ligação entre palavras","items":[{"label":"Ligação entre palavras","note":"Consoante final liga à vogal seguinte: pick it up → pi-ki-tup.","words":["pick it up","turn it off","an apple","check in"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Say one of the best things in your life.","pt":"Diga.","model":"One of the best things is my family."},{"q":"Say the most patient person you know.","pt":"Diga.","model":"My mother is the most patient person."},{"q":"Say the least expensive option.","pt":"Diga.","model":"This is the least expensive option."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 6 superlative sentences about your life.","model":"This is the best trip ever. She is the most patient teacher I know. It was the worst storm of the decade. This is the least expensive option. One of the best cities is Rio. By far the best food is at home.","checklist":["Usei **the most / the least**","Usei **ever**","Usei **one of the**"],"words":"6 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “extreme” mean?","opts":["década","extremo","opção"],"ans":1,"why":"**extreme** = extremo."},{"q":"What does “decade” mean?","opts":["paciente","de longe","década"],"ans":2,"why":"**decade** = década."},{"q":"What does “patient” mean?","opts":["paciente","opção","caro"],"ans":0,"why":"**patient** = paciente."},{"q":"What does “option” mean?","opts":["de longe","opção","oposto"],"ans":1,"why":"**option** = opção."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e procure as palavras-chave."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Use exemplos reais da vida dos alunos e peça frases próprias.","Corrija o erro mais frequente da aula em grupo, sem expor o aluno.","Retome o conteúdo na aula seguinte com um exercício curto."]}]}]}